{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/4k-wallpaper.png?t=1751293809\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dungeon Directive</strong> is a <strong>strategic guild management, auto battler</strong> where you lead from the safety of your guild, while others face the monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re the Guildmaster of a growing frontier town, and a mysterious portal in the center has begun spewing horrors. Your job? Recruit adventurers, prepare your guild, and send parties into the dungeon \u2014 where survival is never guaranteed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Design the Guild</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/SS_Tavern.jpg?t=1751293809\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and furnish your guildhall from the ground up. Stock your tavern, decorate halls, and create the perfect space for adventurers to eat, sleep, and prepare for battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Run the Town</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/SS_Market.jpg?t=1751293809\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage mining, farming, alchemy, and economy. Every resource counts. Every job supports the next dungeon run. Keep the town thriving, and your guild alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Form the Party</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each party member is chosen by a roll of the dice. Luck determines who answers your call \u2014 but it's your strategy that decides if they come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/SS_Roll_for_Party.jpg?t=1751293809\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Plan. Send. Watch.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once inside, parties move automatically across the dungeon board. You don\u2019t control the heroes directly, but you shape everything that happens before they descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/SS_Dungeon_Board_2.jpg?t=1751293809\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Let Them Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat is automatic, but not out of your hands. As Guildmaster, you can intervene with powerful spellcasting to turn the tide at key moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/SS_Battle_1.jpg?t=1751293809\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Dungeon is Alive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/SS_Main_Laser.jpg?t=1751293809\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run pushes deeper, but the dungeon pushes back. Fail too often, and you might wake something worse.<br><strong>Just don\u2019t make it angry.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3751720?t=1751293809","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/f731f68cb4624b548c856ced69b98afd61c10e26/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751293809","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/2c25581e02a692b517a72e0f71a514838607e166/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751293809","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/2c25581e02a692b517a72e0f71a514838607e166/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751293809","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Guild Master Simulator contains fantasy-themed auto-battler combat between NPCs and dungeon monsters. Battles feature stylized blood effects when characters take damage or are defeated. These effects are visual-only and are not exaggerated or realistic. There are no depictions of sexual content, drug use, or self-harm."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/4k-wallpaper.png?t=1751293809\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dungeon Directive</strong> is a <strong>strategic guild management, auto battler</strong> where you lead from the safety of your guild, while others face the monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re the Guildmaster of a growing frontier town, and a mysterious portal in the center has begun spewing horrors. Your job? Recruit adventurers, prepare your guild, and send parties into the dungeon \u2014 where survival is never guaranteed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Design the Guild</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/SS_Tavern.jpg?t=1751293809\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and furnish your guildhall from the ground up. Stock your tavern, decorate halls, and create the perfect space for adventurers to eat, sleep, and prepare for battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Run the Town</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/SS_Market.jpg?t=1751293809\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage mining, farming, alchemy, and economy. Every resource counts. Every job supports the next dungeon run. Keep the town thriving, and your guild alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Form the Party</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each party member is chosen by a roll of the dice. Luck determines who answers your call \u2014 but it's your strategy that decides if they come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/SS_Roll_for_Party.jpg?t=1751293809\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Plan. Send. Watch.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once inside, parties move automatically across the dungeon board. You don\u2019t control the heroes directly, but you shape everything that happens before they descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/SS_Dungeon_Board_2.jpg?t=1751293809\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Let Them Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat is automatic, but not out of your hands. As Guildmaster, you can intervene with powerful spellcasting to turn the tide at key moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/SS_Battle_1.jpg?t=1751293809\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Dungeon is Alive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/extras/SS_Main_Laser.jpg?t=1751293809\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run pushes deeper, but the dungeon pushes back. Fail too often, and you might wake something worse.<br><strong>Just don\u2019t make it angry.</strong></p>","developers":["Rosko Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751720/66ba97c9842744d26b5c82a124831ea712a9663d/header.jpg?t=1751293809","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257159033,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257159033/movie480.mp4?t=1750946569","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257159033/movie_max.mp4?t=1750946569"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257159033/19b407176d8552c325131aa58554749e40548d84/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750946569","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257159033/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750946569","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257159033/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750946569"}}],"name":"Dungeon Directive","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 10400F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GeForce GTX 1050 Ti</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  i7 10700F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li